comment
Randomly selects and plays bird sounds from a folder with 5 samples
Triggers birds at randomized intervals between 2 and 10 seconds.
Applies randomized pitch and volume per event.
Moves each bird smoothly in 3D space (you can use perlin noise or brownian motion)
Draws a visual trail for each moving bird.
Fade In the entire soundscape in 5 seconds
Stops all playback and clears visuals after 60 seconds.
endcomment

5 * oneshot "bird/1to5" every 2to10:
    fade_in = 5
    volume = 0.1to0.5
    pitch = 0.5to1.1
    move = fly, -10to10, 0to20, -10to10, 0.5to1
    visual = trail
    duration = 60